      <p style="color:#cbd5e1;line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:16px;">
        BoldLeads is one of the most well-known lead-generation platforms in real estate. It works by running exclusive Facebook ads for a specific ZIP code, capturing homeowners who request a home valuation, and delivering those "seller leads" to you. It includes a CRM, autoresponders, and landing pages. On paper, it's a complete lead machine — for a recurring price.
      </p>
      <p style="color:#cbd5e1;line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:16px;">
        BirkyStudio competes on a completely different axis. Instead of renting you a lead machine, we deliver a finished product: a verified, enriched, scored list of real prospects for your niche and area. Every entry is checked for a working phone, email, and website, then enriched with data no lead platform provides — does this prospect have a website? An AI agent? A chatbot? A quality score? What do they need from you? You own it forever.
      </p>
