          <h3 style="color:white;font-size:1.3rem;margin:0;">BirkyStudio</h3>
        </div>
        <p style="color:#cbd5e1;line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:16px;">
          BirkyStudio's lead-generation offer starts with a Verified Prospect List: a real, enriched, scored list of prospects built for your niche and area. Every contact is checked for a working phone, email, and website — no bots, no recycled numbers. Then we enrich each one with detail no lead platform gives you: do they have a website? An AI agent? A chatbot? What tech stack? A 0-100 quality score? An "opportunity" tag that tells you exactly how to approach them.
        </p>
        <p style="color:#cbd5e1;line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:16px;">
          You own the list forever. No subscription, no monthly fee, no required ad budget, nothing to cancel. The Pipeline Bundle takes it further: it adds automated outreach, an AI agent trained on your niche and pitch, and an AI receptionist that catches and qualifies replies the moment they bite. That's the closed loop BoldLeads never offers — not just the leads, but the follow-up machine that turns them into conversations.
