          Because it's one-time and fixed-cost, it works for agents at any level. One deal pays for it. And because you own everything, there's no lock-in and nothing to lose if you stop.
        </p>
        <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:24px;margin-bottom:16px;">
          <div>
            <p style="color:white;font-weight:600;font-size:0.9rem;margin-bottom:8px;">✅ Pros</p>
            <ul style="color:#cbd5e1;line-height:1.8;padding-left:20px;">
              <li>Verified, real prospects — not bots or recycled numbers</li>
